The castle shuffler in this folder, and its data in ../data/castle, is a port of the map and room
layout part of SOTN-Shuffler (https://github.com/SestrenExsis/SOTN-Shuffler, commit efb1db1) and of
BIN-Patcher (https://github.com/SestrenExsis/BIN-Patcher, commit cf4d991), both by Sestren and both
under the MIT license below. The room node groups, map drawings, stage links, room logic, validations
and the derived-value rules come from those projects.

The data also includes the parts of these BIN-Patcher patches that change game data, with credit to
the authors named in them:
  - assign-power-of-wolf-relic-a-unique-id: eldri7ch, Mottzilla
  - customize-map-colors: Sestren, Wecoc
  - normalize-castle-entrance: Mottzilla, Sestren
  - normalize-abandoned-mine, normalize-alchemy-laboratory, normalize-clock-tower,
    normalize-long-library, normalize-marble-gallery, normalize-olroxs-quarters,
    normalize-underground-caverns: Sestren

